    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like i've tried the talking to people thing. it doesnt actually change anything. the hole just gets deeper. sometimes i just sit there thinking about how much easier it would be if i just... stopped. if things just ended. does that even make sense? like, is it weird to want an exit?",
