    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like people only want to talk about \"getting better\" because it makes them feel more comfortable, not because it helps me. it's like there's no way to actually win against this feeling. sometimes it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just let go of it all. do you think there's actually any point in fighting it so hard if it's just gonna keep happening?",
